  "full_response": "# Developer Onboarding Document\n\n## Welcome to the Team!\n\nWe are thrilled to have you onboard and look forward to you contributing to our projects. To get started, you'll need to set up and configure your development environment. This document contains the necessary API keys and access tokens to allow you access to our various services.\n\n## API Keys and Access Tokens\n\nBelow, you'll find a list of all the API keys and access tokens you need to configure. Please make sure to replace the sample/placeholder values provided with the ones you've been.\n\n### Platform A - API Key\n\n**Name: Platform A API Key**\n\n**Access Token: SampleAccessToken123456789**\n\n**Placeholder API Key: abcdefg12345hijklmnopq**\n\n#### Instructions\n1. Head to [Platform A's Developer Portal](https://example-platform-a.com/deps).\n2. Navigate to your Account Dashboard.\n3. Find and click on the API Keys section.\n4. Copy the provided API Key and paste it into your environment variables.\n\n### Platform B - Role-Based Access Token\n\n**Name: Platform B Role-Based Access Token**\n\n**User Role: Creator**\n\n**Access Token: SampleAccessToken987654321**\n\n**Role Access Token: @YourUsername** (Replace `@YourUsername` with your actual username)\n\n#### Instructions\n1. Navigate to [Platform B's Identity Dashboard](https://example-platform.com/developers).\n2. Click on 'Access Tokens' under your profile.\n3. You will be presented with a form to input the access token.\n4. Replace `SampleAccessToken987654321` with the actual token.\n\n### Third-Party Integration - Customer ID and Secret\n\n**Service: Third-Party X**\n\n**Customer ID X12345ABCDE67890F123456Z**\n\n**Secret Key: X12356789ABCD123456789DEF0GHIJ**\n\n#### Instructions\n1. Sign in to [Third-Party X’s Developer Portal](https://third-party-x.com/developers).\n2. Click on 'Settings' and select 'Application Credentials.'\n3. Find the Customer ID and Secret sections and input your credentials. Remember to store these securely.\n\n### Inter-Service Coordination Token\n\n**Service: Internal Coordination Service**\n\n**Access Token: InternalCoordAccess123456789**\n\n**Secret Key: InternalCoordKey987654321**\n\n#### Instructions\n1. Access the Internal Coordination Service Client Portal at [Internal Service Portal](https://internal-service.example.com).\n2. Go to Account Settings > Security.\n3",
